WEBVTT

00:05:58.412 --> 00:06:01.292
It's precious, but it's also
really, really difficult.

00:06:03.058 --> 00:06:05.694
Civility talk, on the other hand,

00:06:05.718 --> 00:06:08.575
well, that's really easy,

00:06:08.599 --> 00:06:09.983
really easy,

00:06:10.007 --> 00:06:13.515
and it also is almost always
complete bullshit,

00:06:14.919 --> 00:06:18.292
which makes things slightly awkward for me

00:06:18.316 --> 00:06:20.466
as I continue to talk to you
about civility.

00:06:21.165 --> 00:06:22.777
(Laughter)

00:06:22.801 --> 00:06:26.389
Anyway, we tend to forget it,

00:06:26.413 --> 00:06:29.940
but politicians and intellectuals
have been warning us for decades now

00:06:29.964 --> 00:06:32.560
that the United States
is facing a crisis of civility,